	<!--
		The pause message the *waiting* players get. It names who dropped, because "a participant" left them
		deciding whether a minute of sitting still is worth it without saying who or how much of the group is
		gone. "Reconnecting in 54s" also read as though this device were about to reconnect, when what the
		number counts is how long the match survives without the other player.
